predictable dips in illumination that","occurred_at":null,"published_at":"2026-10-16T13:30:54Z","time_precision":"minute","source_url":"https://steamstore-a.akamaihd.net/news/externalpost/steam_community_announcements/1846651706681478","verified_at":"2026-10-20T21:42:01Z","discovery_method":"official_steam_news","content_review":"source_only"},{"id":"steam-steam-5089240-1846018067929248","game_id":"steam-5089240","kind":"update","title":"Dev Update: How We Animate 2D Anomalies in Kritsana","summary":"Hey everyone! Today, we wanted to share a quick look at how we turn static 2D anomaly art into something that moves and creeps you out in Kritsana.Once the base illustration is done, the process breaks down into three main steps:Step 1: Cutting up the spriteFirst, we slice the artwork into separate pieces: head, torso, arms, legs, and so on. This lets us move each part independently without distorting the whole image.Step 2: Rigging and weight painting Next, we build a 2D skeleton and bind it to","occurred_at":null,"published_at":"2026-10-08T11:04:16Z","time_precision":"minute","source_url":"https://steamstore-a.akamaihd.net/news/externalpost/steam_community_announcements/1846018067929248","verified_at":"2026-10-20T21:42:01Z","discovery_method":"official_steam_news","content_review":"source_only"},{"id":"steam-steam-5089240-1842846814445807","game_id":"steam-5089240","kind":"update","title":"Dev Update: New Scenery Preview","summary":"Hello everyone!It’s been a little while since we released our demo, and we’d love to know how your experience has been so far.Thank you so much for all the feedback and support. Our team has been reading through every single comment, and we’re using your input to make the full game even better. We really can’t wait for you to experience the complete story!If you haven’t already, please consider adding the game to your Steam Wishlist. It really helps us out a lot:Today, we wanted to share a sneak","occurred_at":null,"published_at":"2026-09-04T09:03:00Z","time_precision":"minute","source_url":"https://steamstore-a.akamaihd.net/news/externalpost/steam_community_announcements/1842846814445807","verified_at":"2026-10-20T21:42:01Z","discovery_method":"official_steam_news","content_review":"source_only"}],"analyses":[],"news_status":{"steam-5089240":{"last_attempt_at":"2026-10-26T08:02:23Z","status":"ok","all_sources_checked_at":"2026-10-26T08:02:23Z","error_codes":[]}},"news_last_attempt_at":{"steam-5089240":"2026-10-26T08:02:23Z"},"notices":[],"news_sources":{"5089240":{"last_attempt_at":"2026-10-26T08:02:23Z","last_success_at":"2026-10-26T08:02:23Z","status":"ok","error_codes":[],"last_fulltext_checked_at":"2026-10-26T08:02:23Z"},"5129570":{"last_attempt_at":"2026-10-26T08:02:23Z","last_success_at":"2026-10-26T08:02:23Z","status":"ok","error_codes":[],"last_fulltext_checked_at":"2026-10-26T08:02:23Z"}},"context_snapshots":[{"schema_version":1,"game_id":"steam-5089240","app_id":5089240,"app_scope":"base","observed_at":"2026-10-26T06:15:29Z","source_url":"https://api.steampowered.com/IStoreBrowseService/GetItems/v1/","context":{"country":"KR","language":"koreana","batch_size":100},"status":"ok","error_code":null,"store_item_success":1,"raw_item_sha256":"e8bd68c233fb79aa474c0824402bc462078b42bcc4e841605ce00763dd9754fc","response_sha256":null,"source_fields":{"basic_info":{"short_description":"태국을 배경으로 한 이상 현상 찾기 공포 게임. 1997년, 한 남자는 집 안에 무언가가 있다고 강하게 주장했다. 그의 정신과 의사는 이를 환각으로 치부했다. 이제 이 사건은 당신의 몫이다. 그가 남긴 오래된 CCTV 테이프를 살펴보고, 모든 이상 현상을 신고하고, 이 사건이 왜 끝내 설명되지 않았는지 밝혀내라.","publishers":[{"name":"Debuz Studio","creator_clan_account_id":45288009}],"developers":[{"name":"Debuz Studio","creator_clan_account_id":45288009}]},"release":{"steam_release_date":1793113200,"is_coming_soon":true,"coming_soon_display":"date_full"},"trailers":{"highlights":[{"trailer_name":"Demo Trailer","trailer_url_format":"steam/apps/${FILENAME}?t=1786978823","trailer_category":2,"microtrailer":[{"filename":"5089240/2083052827/51ddcd0ad65b9b9